      "description": "business_hours is INFERRED KNOWLEDGE, not configuration, and it is stamped\n by the server — CreateHumanRequest has no field for it and no RPC updates\n it. Jody, 2026-08-30: \"business hours are really something we can figure\n out on our own... not a setting.\"\n\n It sits on Human rather than on an org type because there is no org type:\n §2 \"Hierarchy\" leaves org structure unsettled and this file does not invent\n it. Per-person is also the finer of the two grains the ruling allowed, so a\n later per-org layer is a source of the PRIOR, not a move of this field.",
      "message": {
