              "name": "AgentReceivedReceipt",
              "package": "messaging",
              "description": "AgentReceivedReceipt is the delivery ACK — the agent (scotty, the mailbox\n service) took the record off the topic and processed it. Written by the\n consumer, never by the sender or by this service.\n\n It is the ACK, not a copy of it: there is one event here, not a delivery ACK\n plus a receipt derived from it.",
              "fields": [
