            "description": "spiffe_id is the record owner. The name is LOAD-BEARING: eventbus's topic\n discovery matches the literal field name \"spiffe_id\" of string type when it\n decides which topics get publisher-identity stamping, so renaming this\n field silently turns the stamping off.\n\n It holds MESSAGING'S OWN service identity, not the sender's, because the\n publish is s2s from this service — that is the direct consequence of the\n SUPERSEDED ruling. `sender` above is where the human is.",
